  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAn alien has kidnapped Matt Damon, not knowing what lengths humanity goes through to retrieve him whenever he goes missing. The aliens are determined to figure out what makes Matt Damon so special that thousands of people would risk their lives to get him back. They begin running tests on him. Is it a biological thing? No, it's not. They then begin to realize it's just a boyish charm, something they can't themselves have. So they come up with a plan to clone him, but unfortunately for them the cloning machine malfunctions.\n\nThey get a bunch of clones of Matt Damon. However, none of them have the same charm. They are just like an every day, average guy.",
